{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y在S11、S13等段落仍有感受条目过密、切分过碎的问题，尤其短停留段落容易让观众来不及消化；X的双栏排法在快速浏览时更轻便。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的优势不只是重点加亮，而是让观众先抓住人物正在经历什么，再通过小字感受和音乐到时出现的提示，逐步感知情绪如何变化。它把受过的伤、对亲近的眷恋、对孤独的恐惧、不愿重蹈覆辙以及最终选择向前生活，连接成了清楚的心理过程；尤其对矛盾产生的原因和细微情绪转折，交代得比X更具体。X的叙述也完整，但右侧感受词常常同时堆积，观众较难判断哪些是关键、哪些属于音乐推进中的短暂变化。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "06ee10fd-e0bf-4976-9c9a-8945e9250944", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T163303837414Z", "elapsed_seconds": 75.922, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T16:34:19.779759+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "79833d73e6afc491fbaac1e7d8781b24b2b7efdeb610dc0e3781aaa1c38ef6da", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\c